  "answer": "I couldn't find a past ticket reporting this exact problem: the first item in the CmdPal context menu being visibly selected as soon as the menu opens, rather than the selection staying hidden until you move. The retrieved tickets cover different problems. #46625 is about the first right-click not opening the context menu on third-party items, #42157 is about no item being selected when a list opens, and #41088 is about an empty item in the more-commands menu. None of them describe this behavior, so there is no documented fix or workaround. Please leave this ticket open for triage. It would help to add expected and actual behavior, and a screenshot or short recording, showing the context menu right after opening with the first item highlighted."
